# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NGINX-PROXY — environment template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# FILE NAY KHONG CHUA SECRET THAT. Copy thanh `compose.nginx-proxy.env`:
#
#   cp compose.nginx-proxy.env.example compose.nginx-proxy.env
#
# `compose.nginx-proxy.env` bi `.gitignore:52` (`compose*.env`) loai bo
# => khong bao gio commit. `.example` duoc `.gitignore:53` cho phep.
#
# Chi co 1 bien BAT BUOC. Image mac dinh da duoc pin tag+digest trong
# `docker-compose.nginx-proxy.yml`, chi doi khi that su can.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── LET'S ENCRYPT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Email nhan thong bao het han cert. BAT BUOC: `${LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL:?}` trong
# compose se lam `docker compose` dung ngay luc parse neu thieu.
LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL=admin@vietdungiitb.vn

# ── TUY CHON: ghim lai image (mac dinh trong compose da la tag+digest) ─────
# NGINX_PROXY_IMAGE=nginxproxy/nginx-proxy:1.11.6@sha256:dd78565eca9742624655bb743723e0aeeab552153c4eea01095e4266c59150d5
# ACME_COMPANION_IMAGE=nginxproxy/acme-companion:2.8.2@sha256:e3c5fb08bf623ae93dbc945d78fe50040c1fa107ddf59f7ee04ba6a61f34cbc1

# ── TUY CHON: chay voi Let's Encrypt STAGING (test, cert khong duoc tin) ──
# Dung khi muon thu nghiem vong xin cert ma khong dam vao rate limit that cua
# Let's Encrypt (5 cert/domain/tuan). Bo comment dong duoi:
# ACME_CA_URI=https://acme-staging-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory
